      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Transport vessels: none. The closing line of Shingū's fascicle-7 return. The middle glyph as printed is 輪 (車 + 侖), not the 輸 of the standard word 運輸船 (unyusen, 'transport vessel'): the reprint's over-inked impression was measured against Mincho templates in three fonts and on all three fascicle-7 pages that carry this field (this page, p089_left, p115_left), and reads 輪 every time — most decisively in the bottom-right of the right component, where 冊 and 月+刂 actually differ. The project's MASTER dataset also records 運輪船 here, and agrees with the scan."
      },
      {
